# Model weights are downloaded on first use, never committed: the checkpoint
# is ~195 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit. `langaai.load()` fetches
# it into langaai/checkpoints/; a source clone may also keep one here.
checkpoints/
langaai/checkpoints/
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors

